              | `tags` | array&lt;Tag&gt; | No |  |
              | `status` | string | No | pet status in the store |


              ## Responses

              ### 405
              Invalid input



              ## Security

              - **petstore_auth**: `write:pets`, `read:pets`
            headers: []
            params:
              - key: ''
                description: ''
                enabled: true
                value:
                  type: string
                  value: ''
            pathParams: []
            tags:
