              |------|----------|------|----------|-------------|
              | `orderId` | path | integer (int64) | Yes | ID of the order that needs to be deleted |

              ## Responses

              ### 400
              Invalid ID supplied



              ### 404
              Order not found
            headers: []
            params: []
            pathParams:
              - key: orderId
                description: ID of the order that needs to be deleted
                value:
                  type: string
                  value: ''
            tags:
              - store
